          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ನಿಧಿ — nidhi — \"a treasure\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಕಥೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ಹುಡುಗರಿಗೆ ಗುಹೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ನಿಧಿ ಸಿಕ್ಕಿತು. katheyalli huḍugarige guheyalli nidhi sikkitu. In the story the boys found a treasure in a cave."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: ನಿಧಿಗಳು, nidhigaḷu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Also a fund: ಕಲ್ಯಾಣ ನಿಧಿ (nidhi), a welfare fund."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ನಿಧಿ (nidhi) is borrowed from Sanskrit nidhi, \"setting down, a hoard\" (CDIAL 7207), from ni-dhā, \"to put down\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
