              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: ಕಡಲ್ಗಳ್ಳರು, kaḍalgaḷḷaru."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಕಡಲ್, sea, and ಕಳ್ಳ, thief: a thief of the sea."
            }
          ]
        },
